#: ../../differences/python_310.rst:145
msgid ""
"The :meth:`~array.array.index` method of :class:`array.array` now has "
"optional *start* and *stop* parameters."
msgstr ""
"Metoden :meth:`~array.array.index` i :class:`array.array` har nu valfria "
